		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-29T18:37:58Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				270,
				5
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Output): Disable PatchTerminalGpuAcceleration, add ViewRegistrySnapshot\n\nTwo changes to the Output build pipeline:\n\n1. Remove PatchTerminalGpuAcceleration from BuildPipeline default order.\n   The transform fixed WebGL atlas font glitches (Menlo loading race) but\n   introduced a \"black shadow over text\" artifact from xterm's DOM-renderer\n   cursor/accessibility layer in WKWebView. Keeping the transform file on\n   disk for potential re-enablement after the input race fix lands.\n\n2. Add ViewRegistrySnapshot() to __CEL_SERVICES__ facade. This diagnostic\n   function queries the workbench's ViewContainersRegistry and ViewsRegistry\n   to return container/view counts + sample IDs. SkyBridge uses this to\n   verify extension manifests (Roo, Claude, gitlens) reached\n   viewsExtensionPoint's setHandler - the most common cause of silent\n   extension panel failures is contributions never flowing through\n   IExtensionService to the registry.",
			"SHA": "325a4de7ad74ebc36c42725572c9f36d4d7b8c3f"
		}
	],
